'''''Fumana laevipes''''' is a species of shrub in the family [[Cistaceae]]. They have a self-supporting growth form, simple, broad leaves and dry fruit. Individuals can grow to 10&nbsp;cm tall.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Fumana laevipes (L.) Spach - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/5733280|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Fumana laevipes (Narrow-leaved needle sunrose) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/CIST/Fumana_laevipes.php |access-date=2022-03-03 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us}}</ref>

